        },
        {
          "text": "Na guchinsikö chiira, keebhörë Motekai wanyoorrë aikaayë kuihita riö ömögambi, Bhigitana na Teresi, bhabhërë bhi ichinture bhö ömögambi bhano bhaarë kuriiha ibhisuumua bhia mönsë, bhakarëërra na körëa inikö ya guita Ömögambi Ahasuero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
